{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>For [כי]</b> crushed [דכא] — a hint to contempt and disgrace." "<b>And the meaning of in darkness [במחשכים]</b> — that he hides from before him, or the distress of the heart is likened to one who sits in darkness and does not see." "<b>Like those long dead [כמתי עולם]</b> — who have a long time since they died."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 143, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:35.222972973Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}